# (round 108) Second CONTROL for the spawn refusal: MODULE-scope
# observation while unobserved workers run puts no FUNCTION into the
# observed set, so this must keep building too -- the refusal is keyed on
# observed functions, not on "the program observes".
define reader() as:
    local seen is 0
    for i in range of 4000:
        seen is seen + 1
    return seen
h1 is spawn of reader
h2 is spawn of reader
b0 is 0
b1 is 1
b1 is 1
rr is report of b1
print of rr
t1 is thread_join of h1
t2 is thread_join of h2
print of t1
print of t2
